   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At the start of the “debate” with Vice President Richard Nixon, Nikita Khrushchev expressed his anger at",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1173671,
     "content_html": "the obviously phony American technology in the model home display"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173670,
     "content_html": "American aggression toward Eastern Europe"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173672,
     "content_html": "Congress’s passage of a resolution recognizing “Captive Nations Week”"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173669,
     "content_html": "the realization that American technology for the home was superior to Soviet technology"
    }
